  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-2 font-display font-bold text-sm tracking-widest" style="color:#1A1A1A;text-transform:uppercase;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif">
      <span>Oldsmar, FL</span><span style="color:#E6A817">·</span><span>CCC1337380</span><span style="color:#E6A817">·</span><span>HappyRoof.com</span><span style="color:#E6A817">·</span><span style="color:#3B9FD9">(813) 595-7663</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="py-20" style="background:#FFFFFF">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="sl gt mb-3">Why Happy Roof in Oldsmar</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);line-height:.95;color:#1A1A1A;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">ROOFING BUILT FOR OLDSMAR HOMES</h2>
        <p style="color:#555555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
          Roofs in Oldsmar deal with a little of everything, from pretty much constant heat and humidity to heavy summer rain and the occasional tropical system moving through the bay area. Over time, that combination can wreak havoc on your roof, especially if your home is already at least a few decades old. In neighborhoods like East Lake, Woodlands, Baywatch, and Oldsmar Heights, for example, we tend to see a lot of houses that are reaching the point where repairs are no longer enough and will need a full replacement in the near future.
        </p>
        <p style="color:#555555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
          At Happy Roof, we install high-quality shingle, metal, and tile roofing systems that are specifically engineered to withstand Florida's harshest weather. Plus, to give you ultimate peace of mind, we always back our work with up to a 15-year workmanship warranty.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="scard p-6"><div class="check"><div class="check-dot"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div><div><strong style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem">Headquartered in Oldsmar</strong><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:.25rem">Our office is right here at 141 Stevens Ave. We are your local roofing team, not an out-of-town company passing through after a storm.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="scard p-6"><div class="check"><div class="check-dot"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div><div><strong style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem">Owens Corning Preferred Contractor</strong><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:.25rem">We're an Owens Corning Preferred Contractor and install all major shingle, metal, and tile brands so you can choose what's right for your home.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="scard p-6"><div class="check"><div class="check-dot"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div><div><strong style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem">Up to 15-Year Workmanship Warranty</strong><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:.25rem">Every Oldsmar roof installation includes a written up to 15-year workmanship warranty on top of manufacturer material warranties.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="scard p-6"><div class="check"><div class="check-dot"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div><div><strong style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem">City of Oldsmar Permits Handled</strong><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:.25rem">We manage all permit applications and inspections with the City of Oldsmar building department, no hassle for you.</p></div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-20" style="background:#F7F7F7">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <p class="sl gt mb-3">Our Services</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);line-height:.95;color:#1A1A1A;letter-spacing:-.01em">ROOFING SERVICES WE OFFER IN OLDSMAR</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="scard p-8">
        <div style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(230,168,23,.1);margin-bottom:1rem"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/></svg></div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.35rem;color:#1A1A1A;margin-bottom:.75rem">Roof Replacement</h3>
        <p style="color:#555555;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7">If repairs just aren't cutting it anymore, it may be time to replace your roof. Our team will handle everything from the tear-off to the decking inspection, underlayment, flashing, installation, cleanup, permits, and final inspection. When we say everything, we mean it. Happy Roof installs Owens Corning Duration shingles, Gulf Coast Supply standing seam and R-panel metal, and concrete and clay tile roofing systems, and we can walk you through the pros and cons of each if you're not sure what would be the best fit for your home.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="scard p-8">
        <div style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(230,168,23,.1);margin-bottom:1rem"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.35rem;color:#1A1A1A;margin-bottom:.75rem">Roof Repair</h3>
        <p style="color:#555555;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7">Not every roofing issue is going to call for a full replacement, and don't let anyone tell you otherwise. If the problem is isolated, we'll focus on fixing the source of it, whether that means replacing missing shingles or patching up storm-related damage before it spreads.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="scard p-8">
        <div style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(230,168,23,.1);margin-bottom:1rem"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4"/><polyline points="16 17 21 12 16 7"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="9" y2="12"/></svg></div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.35rem;color:#1A1A1A;margin-bottom:.75rem">Storm Damage Roofing</h3>
        <p style="color:#555555;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7">Sometimes, storm damage is obvious; other times, it's easy to miss from the ground. If your roof was hit by high winds or heavy rain, we can inspect it and document the damage for you. If you plan to file an insurance claim, we'll also take photos and meet with your adjuster if that's what's needed. Being Oldsmar locals also means our team can respond faster than anyone else in the area.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-20" style="background:#FFFFFF">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <p class="sl gt mb-3">How It Works</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);line-height:.95;color:#1A1A1A;letter-spacing:-.01em">OUR 4-STEP PROCESS</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="scard p-8 flex gap-5"><div class="step-num">1</div><div><h3 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;color:#1A1A1A;margin-bottom:.5rem">Inspection and Assessment</h3><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7">We'll start by taking a look at your roof and the issue you called about, whether it's the shingles or tile, flashing, ventilation, drainage areas, or any signs of underlying damage. Once we've had a chance to inspect everything, we'll explain what we found.</p></div></div>
      <div class="scard p-8 flex gap-5"><div class="step-num">2</div><div><h3 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;color:#1A1A1A;margin-bottom:.5rem">Estimate and Next Steps</h3><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7">Once we know what needs to be done, we'll provide you with a written estimate that includes the scope of the work and pricing. We may also show you material options if you agree a full replacement is the next best step. If it's an insurance-related issue, we can also help you document any damage.</p></div></div>
      <div class="scard p-8 flex gap-5"><div class="step-num">3</div><div><h3 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;color:#1A1A1A;margin-bottom:.5rem">Scheduling and Work</h3><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7">With your approval, we'll schedule the work and order any necessary materials. We'll also take care of permits when the job requires them. Rest assured, our crew will do their part to keep the site as clean and protected as possible throughout the process, from start to finish.</p></div></div>
      <div class="scard p-8 flex gap-5"><div class="step-num">4</div><div><h3 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;color:#1A1A1A;margin-bottom:.5rem">Final Review</h3><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7">When everything's done, we'll start by walking through the final result with you and coordinating any required inspections if needed. You'll also receive any applicable warranty information before the project is officially closed out.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-20" style="background:#F7F7F7">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <p class="sl gt mb-3">Oldsmar Service Area</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);line-height:.95;color:#1A1A1A;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:1rem">NEIGHBORHOODS WE SERVE IN & AROUND OLDSMAR</h2>
      <p style="color:#555555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto">Based right here in Oldsmar, we serve every neighborhood in town and the surrounding communities along the Tampa Bay corridor.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">East Lake Woodlands</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Oldsmar Heights</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Baywatch</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Forest Lakes</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Tampa Bay Golf & CC</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Westfield</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Safety Harbor</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Clearwater</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Palm Harbor</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Westchase</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Citrus Park</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Town 'n' Country</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Dunedin</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Tarpon Springs</span>
      <span class="scard px-4 py-3 text-center" style="font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600">Keystone</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-20" style="background:#FFFFFF">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <p class="sl gt mb-3">Common Questions</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);line-height:.95;color:#1A1A1A;letter-spacing:-.01em">OLDSMAR ROOFING FAQ</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false" onclick="this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',this.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true'?'false':'true');this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('open')">What roofing material works best for homes in Oldsmar?<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A1A1A" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">It depends on the home and what matters most to you. Architectural shingles are one of the most popular choices because they're able to withstand Florida's heat and storm season. However, metal roofs are another favorite if you're looking for something with a longer lifespan that can reflect heat. Either way, if you're unsure, our team can help walk you through your options and how they compare.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false" onclick="this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',this.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true'?'false':'true');this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('open')">Does being near the bay affect roof lifespan?<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A1A1A" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">Unfortunately, yes. The combination of heat, humidity, and salt air can absolutely wear down roofs over time, especially if it's older or was built with lower-quality materials. Not every roof near the water will have issues, but the material you choose still matters.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false" onclick="this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',this.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true'?'false':'true');this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('open')">How much does a new roof cost in Oldsmar?<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A1A1A" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">Most residential roof replacements in Oldsmar fall somewhere between $8,000 and $22,000, though it'll depend on the size of the roof, the material you select, and whether any underlying repairs are needed. It's important to note that a fair amount of homes built in the 1970s through 1990s are now due for replacement. Call <a href="tel:8135957663" class="call-tracking-number" style="color:#3B9FD9;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600">(813) 595-7663</a> for a free estimate.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false" onclick="this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',this.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true'?'false':'true');this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('open')">Do you handle permits?<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A1A1A" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">If your project requires a permit, we'll take care of it and coordinate the inspection process with the City of Oldsmar.</div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false" onclick="this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',this.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true'?'false':'true');this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('open')">How soon can you start?<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1A1A1A" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">It depends on the type of job and whether we have the materials we need. Most of the time we're able to begin within one to three weeks. That said, we do our best to respond much sooner to urgent storm-related issues.</div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-grad relative overflow-hidden py-20">
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 text-center">
    <h2 class="font-display font-black tracking-tightest mb-4" style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.01em">READY TO GET STARTED<span style="color:#F0C040">?</span></h2>
